<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Dreams - Demo</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">grentperez</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Demo(s) About Love</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0JuIcqsgMghcAFbcFWucN6</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.560" end="00:49.450">One day, we'll have a house up on a hill</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.450" end="00:57.450">Where the morning light just peaks over the horizon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.300" end="01:04.300">One day, we'll have some children of our own</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.300" end="01:12.300">Turn that house into a home, no more sleepless nights alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.220" end="01:21.220">Ooh-ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh, ooh, ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.080" end="01:33.750">In years from now I would be calling you my wife</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.750" end="01:41.750">We can spend all of our lives painting by the ocean side</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.120" end="01:48.520">But I guess for now, it will be all inside my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.520" end="01:55.620">An imaginative state, you'd be sleeping in my bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.620" end="02:03.620">While I dream of you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.990" end="02:17.990">I hope that you dream of me too (ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.580" end="02:28.250">What's wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.250" end="02:31.950">What's been going through your mind lately?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.950" end="02:35.510">I'll fetch you flowers and some fresh daisys</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.510" end="02:41.660">And in the morning, we'll feel lazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.660" end="02:44.510">'Cause I know that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.510" end="02:47.990">We could be so good (could be so good)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.990" end="02:51.870">That's us, I know we could</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.870" end="02:55.890">Or maybe, this is all in my</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.890" end="03:03.890">Dream with you, ah, whoa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.040" end="03:17.040">I hope that you dream with me too (ooh, ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:23.990" end="03:31.990">I got my head up in the clouds, it's never coming down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:32.030" end="03:39.460">There's nothing I'd rather do if I'm not here with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:39.460" end="03:46.960">I got my head up in the clouds, it's never coming down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:46.960" end="03:54.010">There's nothing I'd rather do if I'm not here with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:54.010" end="04:01.760">I got my head up in the clouds, it's never coming down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:01.760" end="04:09.760">There's nothing I'd rather do if I'm not here with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:10.460" end="04:18.460">Ooh-ooh, whoa, whoa, oh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:22.440" end="04:30.440">So, I guess I'll just dream of you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:37.790" end="04:45.790">Oh, but my dreams just don't come true</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:51.140" end="04:55.140" /></div></body></tt>